<p>Likha Hai Ya Hussain Muharram Ke Chand Par.<br> Zahra Bhi Aa Gayin Hain Baqiya Ko Chor Kar.<br> Totay Hoye Dilon Ka Sahara Hai Jis Ka Dar.<br> Aa Jao Oss Hussain Ki Janib Karein Safar.<br> Jo Kibriya Ki Shan Muhammad Ki Jan Hai.<br> Haan Apne Zairon Ka Jo Khud Mezban Hai.</p> 
<p>Dam Ba Dam Qadam Qadam Hai Dil Mein Ishq-e-Karbala Hussaina Hussaina.<br> Zairon Ke Qafilon Se Aa Rahi Hai Yeh Sada Hussaina Hussaina.</p> 
<p>Chaley Chalo Barhey Chalo Hussain Ki Sada Suno.<br> Hussain Tum Ko Bola Rahe Hain Hai Samne Karbala.</p> 
<p>Akbar Ke Sath Ghazi Khud Lainay Ja Rahe Hain.<br> Sultan-e-Karbala Ke Mehman Aa Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Parcham Ke Saye Mein Hai Abbas Ki Sawari.<br> Mehmaan Nawaziyon Ki Teyariyaan Hain Jari.<br> Shabeer Ka Haram Hai Halchal Hai Khadmo Mein.<br> Gunbad Pe Shah-e-Dein Ke Parcham Laga Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Jo Be Kafan Hai Oss Ka Darbar Saj Raha Hai.<br> Woh Ho Raha Hai Jo Bhi Abbas Ne Kaha Hai.<br> Hain Surkh Roshni Mein Kalay Libas Walay.<br> Ro Ro Ke Farsh-e-Matam Khadam Bicha Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Ro Ro Ke Keh Rahe Hain Afsoos Hai Yeh Bibi.<br> Aye Kash Hum Jo Hotey Ashor Walay Din Bhi.<br> Nu Lakh Zalimo Mein Tanha Na Hotey Maula.<br> Labaik Keh Rahe Hain Our Rotay Ja Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Norani Chehray Walay Galon Pe Khak Mal Kar.<br> Zawwar Aa Rahe Hain Paidal Najaf Se Chal Kar.<br> Iss Ishq Ke Safar Mein Har Shaks Maizbaan Hai.<br> Kuch Loag Rastay Se Pathar Hata Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Unn Par Salam Ho Jo Besakhiyon Pe Aaye.<br> Paon Ke Bal Nahi They Phir Bhi Na Larkharaye.<br> Milti Nahi Sabhi Ko Yeh Ishq Ki Bulandi.<br> Bas Ya Hussain Keh Kar Woh Chalte Ja Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Thamay Hoye Tabaruk Rahoon Mein Jo Kharey Hain.<br> Qasim Ka Naam Le Kar Taqseem Kar Rahe Hain.<br> Dono Jahan Mein Aisa Jazba Kahin Na Dekha.<br> Jo Saal Bhar Kamaya Woh Sab Luta Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Yeh Woh Zameen Hai Jis Par Pyasi Rahein Sakina.<br> Ghazi Ko Yaad Kar Ke Roti Rahein Sakina.<br> Ab Iss Zameen Pe Koi Pyasa Nahi Hai Dekho.<br> Pyason Ko Mashk Walay Pani Pila Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>ZEESHAN aur RAZA Jab Maula Ke Pas Jana.<br> Hur Ki Qasam Hai Tum Ko Tabdeel Ho Ke Aana.<br> Aye Zaireen-e-Maula Hai Asal Yeh Ziyarat.<br> Unn Ki Hai Mezbani Jo Hur Bana Rahe Hain.</p> 
<p>Tum Apne Dil Mein Ziyarat Ki Aarzu Rakhna.<br> Phir Unn Ka Kam Hai Jazbay Ki Aabro Rakhna.</p>